{
  "name": "Redact sensitive PII in AI prompts and restore responses with Enterprise PII Guardrails",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Enterprise PII Guardrails: Zero-Leak AI Pipeline\n\n### What it does\nAutomatically scrubs personal and sensitive entities (names, email addresses, phone numbers, credit card numbers, medical record numbers) from incoming prompts before forwarding them to an LLM, then restores original values in the final response within your secure perimeter.\n\n### Quick Start (Live Cloud Sandbox)\n1. **Get Free Demo Key**: Visit **https://demo.piiguardrails.com** and click \"API Keys\" in the header to copy your instant demo key.\n2. **Guardrails Credentials**: In n8n, set Base URL to `https://demo.piiguardrails.com` (or `http://localhost:8000` for on-prem) and paste your API Key.\n3. **Execute**: Click \"Test step\" on 'Manual Test Trigger' to run the complete pipeline.\n\n*Note: This self-contained template uses a simulated LLM node, requiring zero third-party AI keys.*",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-main-overview",
      "name": "Template Overview Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Ingestion\nReceives incoming user payload containing raw sensitive customer information.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-phase-1",
      "name": "Phase 1 Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. PII Scrubbing\nReplaces private entities with cryptographically reversible surrogate tokens under 25ms.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-phase-2",
      "name": "Phase 2 Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. LLM Inference (Simulated)\nProcesses the prompt using safe surrogate tokens. Zero raw customer data is leaked.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-phase-3",
      "name": "Phase 3 Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Restore PII\nReconstructs original entities from safe surrogate tokens within your secure perimeter.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-phase-4",
      "name": "Phase 4 Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "node-1-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1a2b3d4-5e6f-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
              "name": "customer_prompt",
              "value": "Hello Support,\n\nMy name is Alice Smith, email: alice.smith@healthcare.corp, phone: +1-415-555-2671. Please check my claim record MRN-998234 and credit card 4111-2222-3333-4444.\n\nThank you!",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-2-set-prompt",
      "name": "Set Customer Prompt with PII",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "mask",
        "text": "={{ $json.customer_prompt }}"
      },
      "id": "node-3-mask-pii",
      "name": "Mask PII with Enterprise Guardrails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-piiguardrails.piiGuardrails",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        580
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "piiGuardrailsApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Enterprise PII Guardrails API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d2e3f4a5-6b7c-8d9e-0f1a-2b3c4d5e6f7a",
              "name": "llm_raw_response",
              "value": "=Dear <PERSON_1>,\n\nWe have received and verified your inquiry regarding claim record <MEDICAL_RECORD_1> and your card <CREDIT_CARD_1>.\n\nA confirmation receipt has been dispatched to your email at <EMAIL_1> and via SMS to <PHONE_1>.\n\nBest regards,\nCustomer Support Team",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-4-simulated-llm",
      "name": "Process Prompt with LLM (Simulated)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "unmask",
        "unmaskText": "={{ $json.llm_raw_response }}",
        "mapping": "={{ $('Mask PII with Enterprise Guardrails').item.json.mapping }}"
      },
      "id": "node-5-unmask-pii",
      "name": "Restore Original PII from Tokens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-piiguardrails.piiGuardrails",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        580
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "piiGuardrailsApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Enterprise PII Guardrails API"
        }
      }
    }
